{
  "chapter": "interface/streaming-ux",
  "tier": "drill",
  "notes": [
    "The stream is a projection of the run, not the run. A timeline of emits, connects,",
    "disconnects, an explicit stop, and idle time is replayed against one buffer.",
    "Every emit gets the next id and is retained. A connect is delivered every buffered",
    "event after its lastEventId, so a refresh resumes rather than restarts and a second",
    "device attaches from zero.",
    "A dropped connection means nothing knowable, so it changes neither the buffer nor the",
    "run. Only an explicit stop cancels. Idle time accrues only while nobody is watching,",
    "and reaching the policy abandons the run — a decision made in advance, not inferred.",
    "A finished run keeps its buffer, so a client can still read what happened."
  ],
  "abandonAfterMinutes": 30,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "a-new-client-gets-the-stream-from-the-beginning",
      "timeline": [
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Reading ticket #8823" },
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Looking up order 4921" },
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Checking policy RET-14" },
        { "kind": "connect", "client": "tab-1", "lastEventId": null }
      ],
      "result": {
        "status": "running",
        "buffer": [
          { "id": 1, "text": "Reading ticket #8823" },
          { "id": 2, "text": "Looking up order 4921" },
          { "id": 3, "text": "Checking policy RET-14" }
        ],
        "deliveries": [{ "client": "tab-1", "events": [1, 2, 3] }]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-refresh-resumes-where-it-left-off",
      "timeline": [
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Reading ticket #8823" },
        { "kind": "connect", "client": "tab-1", "lastEventId": null },
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Looking up order 4921" },
        { "kind": "disconnect", "client": "tab-1" },
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Checking policy RET-14" },
        { "kind": "connect", "client": "tab-1", "lastEventId": 1 }
      ],
      "result": {
        "status": "running",
        "buffer": [
          { "id": 1, "text": "Reading ticket #8823" },
          { "id": 2, "text": "Looking up order 4921" },
          { "id": 3, "text": "Checking policy RET-14" }
        ],
        "deliveries": [
          { "client": "tab-1", "events": [1] },
          { "client": "tab-1", "events": [2, 3] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-disconnect-does-not-stop-the-run",
      "timeline": [
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Reading ticket #8823" },
        { "kind": "connect", "client": "tab-1", "lastEventId": null },
        { "kind": "disconnect", "client": "tab-1" },
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Looking up order 4921" },
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Issuing the credit" }
      ],
      "result": {
        "status": "running",
        "buffer": [
          { "id": 1, "text": "Reading ticket #8823" },
          { "id": 2, "text": "Looking up order 4921" },
          { "id": 3, "text": "Issuing the credit" }
        ],
        "deliveries": [{ "client": "tab-1", "events": [1] }]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-second-device-attaches-from-zero",
      "timeline": [
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Reading ticket #8823" },
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Looking up order 4921" },
        { "kind": "connect", "client": "tab-1", "lastEventId": null },
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Checking policy RET-14" },
        { "kind": "connect", "client": "phone", "lastEventId": null }
      ],
      "result": {
        "status": "running",
        "buffer": [
          { "id": 1, "text": "Reading ticket #8823" },
          { "id": 2, "text": "Looking up order 4921" },
          { "id": 3, "text": "Checking policy RET-14" }
        ],
        "deliveries": [
          { "client": "tab-1", "events": [1, 2] },
          { "client": "phone", "events": [1, 2, 3] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "an-explicit-stop-ends-the-run",
      "timeline": [
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Reading ticket #8823" },
        { "kind": "connect", "client": "tab-1", "lastEventId": null },
        { "kind": "stop" },
        { "kind": "emit", "text": "Issuing the credit" }
      ],
      "result": {
        "status": "cancelled",
        "buffer": [{ "id": 1, "text": "Reading ticket #8823" }],
        "deliveries": [{ "client": "tab-1", "events": [1] }]
      }
    },
